<p dir=3D"auto">A client side implementation of the ONVIF specification for=
 Linux, Mac and Windows. Included are two tools for communicating with came=
ras, a command line program, onvif-util, and a program with a Graphical Use=
r Interface, onvi-gui.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">&nbsp;</p>

