<p dir=3D"auto">If you would like to use the NPU on Intel, the driver can b=
e installed as follows.</p>
<div class=3D"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overf=
low-auto"><pre class=3D"notranslate"><code>sudo snap install intel-npu-driv=
er
sudo chown root:render /dev/accel/accel0
sudo chmod g+rw /dev/accel/accel0
sudo usermod -a -G render $USER
sudo bash -c "echo 'SUBSYSTEM=3D=3D\"accel\", KERNEL=3D=3D\"accel*\", GROUP=
=3D\"render\", MODE=3D\"0660\"' &gt; /etc/udev/rules.d/10-intel-vpu.rules"
sudo udevadm control --reload-rules
sudo udevadm trigger --subsystem-match=3Daccel
sudo reboot now
