<p dir=3D"auto">Mute</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Camera audio can be controlled from the panel. The mute but=
ton can be clicked to mute the audio. The mute button appearance indicates =
the state of the audio. The volume slider can be used to control the volume=
. Note that the mute and volume controls are applied to each camera individ=
ually.</p>
