ched addresses. Use the Discover button to find the camera, or enter the ne=
w address manually from the settings panel.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Take care when changing these settings, the program does no=
t check for errors and it maybe possible to set the camera into an unreacha=
ble configuration.</p>
