<p dir=3D"auto">When selected, this option will cause the application to di=
scover cameras automatically when it starts. This holds true whether the ap=
plication is using Broadcast Discovery or Cached Addresses.  Note that if t=
his option is selected and the Broadcast Discovery Option is also selected,=
 the application will poll the network once per minute to find missing or n=
ew cameras.</p>
