<p dir=3D"auto">File management will remove oldest files based on the total=
 size limit set in the Auto Management field. Because the calculation used =
by the manager is not exact, an additional buffer space is allocated for sa=
fety. The default value should be sufficient, but can be ajusted based on c=
onditions if warranted.</p>
