<p dir=3D"auto">MacOS has a number of qualities that make it desirable as a=
 server platform. It has a capable NPU that can process YOLO models for inf=
erence in a very power-efficient manner. It has a good built in DHCP server=
 that can easily be used for the camera network. It has a polished graphica=
l interface capable of driving multiple monitors. It will also run silent i=
n most conditions without creating a lot of fan noise which can be problema=
tic with some systems.</p>
