<p dir=3D"auto">Apple Silicon is very power efficient, and features have be=
en added to the operating system to further enhance efficiency. These featu=
res can have the effect of making the server sleep or get behind in process=
ing video frames that are sent by the cameras. This is undesirable when dep=
ending upon the alarm function as the data is not processed in a timely man=
ner. The settings for Energy should be adjusted to disable the low power mo=
de for the device during periods of no user interaction. The setting "Preve=
nt automatic sleeping when the display is off" should be set to on.</p>
