<p dir=3D"auto">The operating system will limit the number of file handles =
that can be open simoultaneously. These handles are also associated with ne=
twork socket creation. This has the effect of limiting the number of client=
s that can connect to the server. In order to increase the number of handle=
s, the <code>ulimit</code> command can be used.</p>
