<summary>File Sharing on Mac OS</summary>
<p dir=3D"auto">&nbsp;</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Open Sharing Settings: Go to the Apple menu &gt; System Set=
tings &gt; General &gt; Sharing (scroll down if needed).</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Enable File Sharing: Turn on the toggle for File Sharing.</=
p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Configure SMB: Click the info button (i) or Options next to=
 File Sharing.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Turn on SMB Sharing: Check the box for "Share files and fol=
ders using SMB".</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Select Users: Under "Windows File Sharing," check the box f=
or each user account that needs access and enter their password.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">(Optional) Add Folders: In the main Sharing window, use the=
 "+" button to add specific folders to share and set their permissions (rea=
d/write for users).</p>
</details>
