<details><summary>Shared networking for QEMU</summary>
&nbsp;
<hr>
<p dir=3D"auto">Taken from this <a href=3D"https://serverfault.com/question=
s/1075408/can-i-have-my-kvm-guests-on-the-same-subnet-as-the-host" rel=3D"n=
ofollow">link</a></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The objective of this installation is that virtual machines=
 share the same network as the host.</p>
<div class=3D"markdown-heading" dir=3D"auto"><h3 tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"h=
eading-element" dir=3D"auto">Set up the logical network bridge on the host<=
/h3><a id=3D"user-content-set-up-the-logical-network-bridge-on-the-host" cl=
ass=3D"anchor" aria-label=3D"Permalink: Set up the logical network bridge o=
