<p dir=3D"auto"><b>Note that this configuration will disable the network in=
terface from the host perspective. It is recommended to add a usb network a=
dapter if you only have one ethernet interface (please refer to note at the=
 bottom of this section</b></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Create <code>/etc/netplan/01-kvmbridge.yaml</code>. Example=
:</p>
<div class=3D"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overf=
low-auto"><pre class=3D"notranslate"><code>network:
  ethernets:
    enp4s0:
      dhcp4: true
  bridges:
    virbr0:
      interfaces: [enp4s0]
      dhcp4: true
      mtu: 1500
      parameters:
        stp: true
        forward-delay: 15
</code></pre><div class=3D"zeroclipboard-container">
