<p dir=3D"auto">Notes: NIC name will differ depending on driver. Address as=
signment doesn't have to be by DHCP.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Run <code>sudo netplan try</code> to test the config and <c=
ode>sudo netplan apply</code> to apply it once you're satisfied it works. N=
ote that changing a network config over ssh may not be a good idea.</p>
