to be persistent by editing the configuration file <code>~./profile</code>.=
 Please note that the Wayland server does not allow windows to position the=
mselves when starting. The effect of this is that the application window an=
d error message dialogs will always appear in the upper left of the screen =
when starting.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">It has been observed that the application running X11 force=
